// Single pinned entry point for installing sccache. Everything else must route
// through it: sccache allows one server per user and a client whose version
// differs from the running server SHUTS IT DOWN, so an unpinned install on a
// many-worker self-hosted host kills the shared server out from under whatever
// unrelated job is mid-compile (burin-labs/burin-code#5328). The upstream action
// installs the LATEST sccache when no version is given, which makes "unpinned"
// a time bomb rather than a style question.
const SCCACHE_INSTALL_ACTION_PATH = ".github/actions/sccache-install/action.yml"

